
## Frontend components

Register the plugin's components in your panel's entry (`resources/js/alfakit/app.*`):

```ts
import { components as {{ jsName }}Components } from '{{ npmPackage }}'

createAlfakit({ components: { ...{{ jsName }}Components } })
```

Then render them from PHP, for example `View::make('{{ id }}:example')->props(['message' => 'Hello'])`.
